<title>UK: BP sees delayed Foinaven onstream before year-end.</title>
<headline>BP sees delayed Foinaven onstream before year-end.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum plc said on Tuesday it now hoped to see first crude from its much delayed U.K. Foinaven oilfield development by the end of the year.</p>
<p>&quot;I think by the end of the year we hope to be in production,&quot; said BP Exploration chief executive Rodney Chase.</p>
</text>
